WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.900
- I don't know how you skinny
people do this shit.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.340
- (upbeat music)

00:00:07.535 --> 00:00:08.852
- So my friend Curly
told me his resolution

00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:11.696
this year is to get in shape,
except he hates working out.

00:00:11.696 --> 00:00:13.251
Well, the good news is I love working

00:00:13.251 --> 00:00:16.583
out, so I'm gonna help him out. Hi Curly.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:17.435
- Hey.

00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:18.655
- So you don't like working out,

00:00:18.655 --> 00:00:20.727
but we're gonna figure
out what you do like.

00:00:20.727 --> 00:00:21.539
- Okay.

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:24.158
- Would you rather be inside or outside?

00:00:24.418 --> 00:00:25.394
- Inside.

00:00:25.394 --> 00:00:27.079
- Alone or with a group of people?

00:00:27.079 --> 00:00:29.790
- I'd say alone, but I don't
mind one other person or so.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.036
- Would you say that you're like,

00:00:32.546 --> 00:00:34.109
an intense person or more chill?

00:00:34.109 --> 00:00:35.976
- I'd say more chill, I
hate when like, you make

00:00:35.976 --> 00:00:37.894
that ugly face when you're
getting really into it

00:00:37.894 --> 00:00:39.362
and I don't want to make that ugly face.

00:00:39.362 --> 00:00:40.928
- Okay, okay, I think this is gonna

00:00:40.928 --> 00:00:42.503
be easy. I'll call ya later.

00:00:42.503 --> 00:00:43.358
- Okay.

00:00:43.358 --> 00:00:45.816
- I figured out something
I think Curly might like,

00:00:45.816 --> 00:00:48.132
so I told him to get changed
and meet me at my apartment.

00:00:48.132 --> 00:00:49.250
- Let's do this.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.530
- What is this outfit?

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:51.627
- It's all I have to wear.

00:00:51.627 --> 00:00:54.695
- I think I have created a
workout that you might not hate.

00:00:55.135 --> 00:00:55.987
- I'm scared.

00:00:55.987 --> 00:00:57.368
- Don't be scared. You're gonna be fine.

00:00:57.368 --> 00:00:58.790
- Let's make this ridiculous.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:00:59.989
- I, oh Curly.

00:00:59.989 --> 00:01:02.143
- (laughing)

00:01:03.303 --> 00:01:04.728
- We're gonna do ten push-ups.

00:01:04.728 --> 00:01:05.602
- Okay.

00:01:05.602 --> 00:01:07.939
- We're gonna 20 split squats

00:01:07.939 --> 00:01:08.453
- Okay.

00:01:08.453 --> 00:01:09.302
- Do 10 on each leg.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.326
Then we're gonna do 30
or the glute bridges.

00:01:11.326 --> 00:01:11.670
- Okay.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.743
- We're gonna do a 40 second plank,

00:01:13.743 --> 00:01:16.831
50 jumping jacks and
then 60 seconds of rest.

00:01:16.831 --> 00:01:17.644
- 50 in a row?

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:18.224
- Yeah.

00:01:18.224 --> 00:01:18.923
- And then do it again?

00:01:18.923 --> 00:01:21.341
- And we're gonna do it
again. At least one more time,

00:01:21.341 --> 00:01:23.515
maybe two more times. Are you excited?

00:01:23.515 --> 00:01:24.368
- Not really.

00:01:24.368 --> 00:01:26.532
- You should be.

00:01:26.532 --> 00:01:29.558
- (upbeat music)

00:01:44.573 --> 00:01:46.967
- See, this is where I
don't like working out.

00:01:46.967 --> 00:01:50.023
It's like, you have to be very vulnerable,

00:01:50.023 --> 00:01:53.155
and very okay with looking ridiculous.

00:01:53.698 --> 00:01:56.833
- (upbeat music)

00:02:04.141 --> 00:02:05.319
- Can you hear my heartbeat?

00:02:05.319 --> 00:02:08.565
How do people not throw up
when they work out? Because...

00:02:08.565 --> 00:02:10.375
- Sometimes they throw up.

00:02:12.965 --> 00:02:13.961
- What number are we on?

00:02:13.961 --> 00:02:14.835
- (laughing)

00:02:14.835 --> 00:02:17.177
- Nine, ten.

00:02:26.306 --> 00:02:30.832
- I'm like, not even present
anymore. I'm like, in my brain.

00:02:30.832 --> 00:02:33.749
- Honestly though, that's the
part I like about working out.

00:02:33.749 --> 00:02:35.113
- That you just let
your body do its thing?

00:02:35.113 --> 00:02:39.496
- Mmhmm. Alright, jumping jacks.

00:02:39.676 --> 00:02:41.714
- This is like, a really good workout that

00:02:41.714 --> 00:02:43.435
I haven't had in a really long time.

00:02:47.925 --> 00:02:48.886
- 50.

00:02:48.886 --> 00:02:49.541
- Woohoo!

00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:53.570
- Now we get to rest again for a minute.

00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:04.982
- (uptempo reggae music)

00:03:12.502 --> 00:03:16.229
Okay, we're done. So,
would you do it again?

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:18.922
- Yeah actually. I love it,
it's great, I feel really good.

00:03:18.922 --> 00:03:20.196
I feel like I'm gonna go
back to my table at my desk

00:03:20.196 --> 00:03:23.256
and be like, yeah, you did
something productive today.

00:03:23.256 --> 00:03:23.977
- Yeah.

00:03:23.977 --> 00:03:24.739
- Thank you so much.

00:03:24.739 --> 00:03:25.768
- Thanks for working out with me.

00:03:25.768 --> 00:03:26.718
- For sure-den.

00:03:26.728 --> 00:03:27.941
- I'm glad you didn't hate it.

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:29.446
- No, I loved it. In full...

00:03:29.446 --> 00:03:30.969
- Success!

00:03:30.969 --> 00:03:31.775
- I'm gonna go shower.

00:03:31.775 --> 00:03:33.839
- It was a success. Here's the thing.

00:03:33.839 --> 00:03:36.236
Most people who tell you
they like working out

00:03:36.236 --> 00:03:38.085
don't like it because they like being

00:03:38.085 --> 00:03:40.422
exhausted and sweaty and tired.

00:03:40.422 --> 00:03:42.940
They like it because of how
they feel after, so don't

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:46.319
be discouraged if it's hard.
It's supposed to be hard.

00:03:46.319 --> 00:03:47.559
You just have to find
something that you don't

00:03:47.559 --> 00:03:49.245
totally hate doing and it'll feel like a

00:03:49.245 --> 00:03:51.725
cool challenge instead
of like a punishment.

